{"step_index":158,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:54:25Z","content":"Here is your updated website with the **Top 5 Famous Places**, a **5-Stamp Collectible Tourist Passport**, and a **Crazy Cinematic Expedition Vault Unlock Animation** on first visit!\n\n---\n\n### 🗝️ 1. Crazy Cinematic Vault Unlock Animation\nWhen visitors open the website:\n- **Locked Expedition Portal**: The website starts covered by a dark, atmospheric cosmic forest gateway with spinning brass celestial rings and a glowing golden **Royal Ancient Vault Seal** `[ 🗝️ UNLOCK ]`.\n- **The Crazy Click Explosion**:\n  - Clicking the seal causes a radiant golden flash explosion!\n  - **160+ golden & emerald embers and confetti particles** burst radially outward across the entire screen!\n  - The vault doors split and dissolve open via an iris-warp animation (`clip-path: circle(0%)`).\n  - The hero section smoothly zooms in with cinematic motion blur into crisp clarity.\n  - A celebratory notification slides down: *\"👑 Expedition Vault Unlocked! Welcome to Jharkhand\"*.\n\n---\n\n### 🏛️ 2. Top 5 Famous Destinations\nThe site is now strictly focused on the **Top 5 most famous iconic destinations** of Jharkhand with 100% authentic Wikimedia Commons photography:\n1. 🌊 **Hundru Falls** (Ranchi) — The 98-meter plunge onto sculpted basalt rocks\n2. 🛣️ **Patratu Valley & Dam** (Ramgarh) — 30 hairpin switchback ghat road and reservoir waters\n3. 🛕 **Baba Baidyanath Dham** (Deoghar) — Sacred Shiva Jyotirlinga crowned with rare Panchasula\n4. ⛰️ **Parasnath Hill (Shikharji)** (Giridih) — Highest summit in Jharkhand (1,365m)\n5. 🐅 **Betla National Park** (Latehar) — Primeval Sal forests, wild tigers & 16th-century Chero forts\n\n---\n\n### 🎒 3. 5-Stamp Collectible Tourist Passport\n- **5 Collectible Stamp Badges**:\n  - 🌊 *Waterfall Conqueror* (Hundru Falls)\n  - 🛣️ *Serpentine Master* (Patratu Valley)\n  - 🛕 *Sacred Pilgrim* (Baba Baidyanath Dham)\n  - ⛰️ *Summit Explorer* (Parasnath Hill)\n  - 🐅 *Jungle Trailblazer* (Betla National Park)\n- **How Tourists Collect Stamps**:\n  - Hovering on any card for 1.2s, clicking \"Explore Details\", or clicking a map pin collects that place's official stamp with an animated confetti burst.\n  - As stamps are collected, your Traveler Rank upgrades from *Novice Tourist* $\\to$ *Forest Wanderer* $\\to$ *Ghat Explorer* $\\to$ *Pilgrim Adventurer* $\\to$ *Plateau Trailblazer* $\\to$ **Grand Master of Jharkhand 👑**!\n  - Includes a **\"✨ Unlock All 5 Stamps (Demo Mode)\"** button inside the Passport Modal to test the ultimate celebration anytime.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Experience It Right Now\n\nYour local development server is running live:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)** *(Open or refresh to experience the full Vault Gateway opening animation!)*"}
